{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2283"},"reason":"a2283 body: the characters rewritten from the source (Anton the practical handyman, Berti the diligent one, Conni the musical one, Det the clever one with glasses, Edi the rascal, Fritzchen the sporty one). The merge had invented traits such as \"Conni the most childlike, Det looks after him like a father\" and \"Edi the red-haired rascal\", and its claim that \"Gud'n Aaamd\" is a pun on Gutenberg was false (that pun is the name of the dog Guudnberg). Added the 2003 manga redesign, ~50,000 spots, the 2013 honorary title from Mainz and the 2016 Det traffic lights — https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainzelm%C3%A4nnchen","by":"enrich batch 070","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a2279-a0639.md","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainzelm%C3%A4nnchen"}]},
